{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "看清再签",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 95.46,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "回到开头的冷钱包。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的冷钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.939
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "六把钥匙里，WazirX 持五把，Liminal 持一把。",
   "spoken": "六把钥匙里，WazirX 持五把，Liminal 持一把。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 3.34,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 3.433,
   "speechEnd": 7.51
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "签名人在 Liminal 界面上看到的交易，和实际签下的不一样。",
   "spoken": "签名人在 Liminal 界面上看到的交易，和实际签下的不一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 7.96,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 7.96,
   "speechEnd": 12.532
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "实际签下的，是一次合约升级，钱包控制权被转走。",
   "spoken": "实际签下的，是一次合约升级，钱包控制权被转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 12.98,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 12.98,
   "speechEnd": 17.69
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "接手的是一个恶意合约，它提前 8 天就部署好。",
   "spoken": "接手的是一个恶意合约，它提前 8 天就部署好。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 18.16,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 18.25,
   "speechEnd": 22.014
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "WazirX 称，问题出在 Liminal 界面显示的数据。",
   "spoken": "WazirX 称，问题出在 Liminal 界面显示的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 22.38,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 22.475,
   "speechEnd": 26.115
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "Liminal 称，自己的基础设施没有被攻破，是受害方的 3 台机器被注入恶意载荷。",
   "spoken": "Liminal 称，自己的基础设施没有被攻破，是受害方的 3 台机器被注入恶意载荷。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 26.52,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 26.614,
   "speechEnd": 33.123
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "这一争议，没有见到最终的独立报告。",
   "spoken": "这一争议，没有见到最终的独立报告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 33.54,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 33.635,
   "speechEnd": 36.549
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "多签只保证，足够多的人同意某个哈希。",
   "spoken": "多签只保证，足够多的人同意某个哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 36.96,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 37.062,
   "speechEnd": 40.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "它不管这个哈希，代表的是哪一笔交易。",
   "spoken": "它不管这个哈希，代表的是哪一笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 40.54,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 40.54,
   "speechEnd": 43.64
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "签名人看到的和实际签的不一样，每把钥匙都会正常工作。",
   "spoken": "签名人看到的和实际签的不一样，每把钥匙都会正常工作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 44.04,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 44.13,
   "speechEnd": 49.002
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "防线在签名人自己这一侧。",
   "spoken": "防线在签名人自己这一侧。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 49.46,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 49.46,
   "speechEnd": 51.476
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "每个签名人，在自己的设备上，用另一套代码，独立算一遍交易哈希。",
   "spoken": "每个签名人，在自己的设备上，用另一套代码，独立算一遍交易哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 51.92,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 52.021,
   "speechEnd": 57.119
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "再在硬件钱包屏幕上，核对收款地址、金额、数据和操作类型。",
   "spoken": "再在硬件钱包屏幕上，核对收款地址、金额、数据和操作类型。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 57.5,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 57.5,
   "speechEnd": 63.361
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "设备把交易解析成人能读懂的字段再签，这叫清晰签名。",
   "spoken": "设备把交易解析成人能读懂的字段再签，这叫清晰签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 63.8,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 63.8,
   "speechEnd": 69.029
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "例行转账，操作类型应该是 CALL。",
   "spoken": "例行转账，操作类型应该是 CALL。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 69.46,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 69.555,
   "speechEnd": 72.085
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "如果是 DELEGATECALL，就是让多签合约执行外部代码，不签。",
   "spoken": "如果是 DELEGATECALL，就是让多签合约执行外部代码，不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 72.48,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 72.581,
   "speechEnd": 77.33
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "大额交易，再用电话或当面，确认发起人身份。",
   "spoken": "大额交易，再用电话或当面，确认发起人身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 77.74,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 77.835,
   "speechEnd": 81.71
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "签名人不能共用一台电脑、一个浏览器、一个前端，共用就是单点。",
   "spoken": "签名人不能共用一台电脑、一个浏览器、一个前端，共用就是单点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 82.12,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 82.12,
   "speechEnd": 88.081
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "局限是，如果所有人用同一个解码工具，这个工具就是新的单点。",
   "spoken": "局限是，如果所有人用同一个解码工具，这个工具就是新的单点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 88.5,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 88.5,
   "speechEnd": 94.043
  }
